  {
    "Language": "zh_cn",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "丝瓜",
      "anchor": "loofah",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): 15°C - 36°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 40 - 85 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 45 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 30 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 50$()$(br2)丝瓜是$(thing)攀爬性作物$()。嫩时做汤，老了只剩一团纤维。$(br2)种子播在$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()上，上方留空，用木棍右键下半株搭架才能继续长高。完全成熟后破坏任意半株收获并返种、返棍，各结算一次；空手右键不采摘。$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "zh_cn",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "苦瓜",
      "anchor": "bitter_melon",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): 16°C - 38°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 35 - 80 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 40 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 35 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 50$()$(br2)苦瓜是$(thing)攀爬性作物$()。苦味来自瓜肉，越熟越苦。$(br2)种子播在$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()上，上方留空，用木棍右键下半株搭架才能继续长高。完全成熟后破坏任意半株收获并返种、返棍，各结算一次；空手右键不采摘。$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "zh_cn",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "蛇瓜",
      "anchor": "snake_gourd",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): 18°C - 38°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 40 - 85 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 40 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 35 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 50$()$(br2)蛇瓜是$(thing)攀爬性作物$()。能垂到两米长的细长瓜。$(br2)种子播在$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()上，上方留空，用木棍右键下半株搭架才能继续长高。完全成熟后破坏任意半株收获并返种、返棍，各结算一次；空手右键不采摘。$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "zh_cn",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "佛手瓜",
      "anchor": "chayote",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): 15°C - 34°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 40 - 90 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 40 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 35 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 50$()$(br2)佛手瓜是$(thing)攀爬性作物$()。需支架才能长高，成熟后连株收获。$(br2)种子播在$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()上，上方留空，用木棍右键下半株搭架才能继续长高。完全成熟后破坏任意半株收获并返种、返棍，各结算一次；空手右键不采摘。$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "en_us",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Loofah",
      "anchor": "loofah",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)Temperature$(): 15°C - 36°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)Hydration$(): 40 - 85 %$(br)$(bold)Category$(): Vegetable$(br2)$(bold)$(3)Nitrogen$(): 45 $(bold)$(6)Phosphorous$(): 30 $(bold)$(d)Potassium$(): 50$()$(br2)Loofah is a $(thing)climbing crop$(): tender in soup, nothing but fibre when old.$(br2)Sow on $(l:tfc:food/farmland)farmland$() with space above. To grow tall, right-click the lower plant with a wooden stick. Once fully grown, break either half to harvest and return seeds and the stick once. Empty-hand right-click does not harvest.$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "en_us",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Bitter Melon",
      "anchor": "bitter_melon",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)Temperature$(): 16°C - 38°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)Hydration$(): 35 - 80 %$(br)$(bold)Category$(): Vegetable$(br2)$(bold)$(3)Nitrogen$(): 40 $(bold)$(6)Phosphorous$(): 35 $(bold)$(d)Potassium$(): 50$()$(br2)Bitter Melon is a $(thing)climbing crop$(): the bitterness is in the flesh, stronger as it ripens.$(br2)Sow on $(l:tfc:food/farmland)farmland$() with space above. To grow tall, right-click the lower plant with a wooden stick. Once fully grown, break either half to harvest and return seeds and the stick once. Empty-hand right-click does not harvest.$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "en_us",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Snake Gourd",
      "anchor": "snake_gourd",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)Temperature$(): 18°C - 38°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)Hydration$(): 40 - 85 %$(br)$(bold)Category$(): Vegetable$(br2)$(bold)$(3)Nitrogen$(): 40 $(bold)$(6)Phosphorous$(): 35 $(bold)$(d)Potassium$(): 50$()$(br2)Snake Gourd is a $(thing)climbing crop$(): a gourd that hangs two meters long.$(br2)Sow on $(l:tfc:food/farmland)farmland$() with space above. To grow tall, right-click the lower plant with a wooden stick. Once fully grown, break either half to harvest and return seeds and the stick once. Empty-hand right-click does not harvest.$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "en_us",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Chayote",
      "anchor": "chayote",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)Temperature$(): 15°C - 34°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)Hydration$(): 40 - 90 %$(br)$(bold)Category$(): Vegetable$(br2)$(bold)$(3)Nitrogen$(): 40 $(bold)$(6)Phosphorous$(): 35 $(bold)$(d)Potassium$(): 50$()$(br2)Chayote is a $(thing)climbing crop$(): needs support to grow tall and is removed at harvest.$(br2)Sow on $(l:tfc:food/farmland)farmland$() with space above. To grow tall, right-click the lower plant with a wooden stick. Once fully grown, break either half to harvest and return seeds and the stick once. Empty-hand right-click does not harvest.$(br2)"
    }
  },
